description=Skills stay vanilla; on top come masteries, named groups of skills (Firearms, Construction, Hunting...) with effects of their own. Pick up to three once every skill in them is at level 10; a picked mastery grows from experience to mastery 10, then prestige. Mastery tab next to Skills, vanilla-style level-ups, and click any skill in the Skills tab to see what its level gives. Works on dedicated servers.
